128
00:13:31,970 --> 00:13:33,170
Tina.

129
00:13:33,928 --> 00:13:35,128
Her name is Tina.

130
00:13:38,095 --> 00:13:39,803
Very nice. Welcome, Tina.

131
00:13:41,845 --> 00:13:43,045
