Mrs. Curières, from
France, and little Tina.

136
00:13:55,803 --> 00:13:58,303
Maria, they are waiting
for us. We have to go.

137
00:13:58,470 --> 00:13:59,561
Bye, Tina.

138
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:00,753
