asylum is expensive.

167
00:16:16,970 --> 00:16:20,595
With our methods at the institute,
which are among the most modern...

168
00:16:20,761 --> 00:16:22,220
in the world belong

169
00:16:22,386 --> 00:16:25,386
we can teach them to
